# A table indexed by a field with an alternative the table has no entry for.
-- source.cue --
t: "a" | "b" | "c"
-- target.cue --
u: 1 | 2
-- lens.cue --
_T: {a: 1, b: 2}
v0_0: _
v1_0: {u: _T[v0_0.t]}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.u indexes a table by v0_0.t, which may be "c", for which the table has no entry (rule table-key-missing) @ lens.cue:3:11
